  "description": "Those looking for a modern hardtail trail bike should check out the Eccentric Lite. Sure, it's light and looks rad, but the key point is the unique geometry – not commonly found in this category - that makes this bike special. The slack angles and long reach inspire confidence. No matter if you are a beginner or expert, you shouldn’t be riding short old-school donkeys. Both models in the Eccentric Lite range rock right out of the box, but they are also a great base for future upgrades.\nINTENDED USE CATEGORY 4: XC & TRAIL\nMAIN FEATURES:\n- Tough and light alloy frame\n- Radical geo with slack angles\n- RST alpha 29 120mm boost 15mm taper\n- rebound and speed lock adjustment\n- Hydraulic Shimano MT200 disc brakes\n- SHIMANO deore 1x10 dERAILLEUR\n- NS Bikes cockpit\nMODERN GEOMETRY\nMost progressive frame geometry on the market.\nTOUGH AND LIGHT ALLOY FRAME\nTange eccentric cromoly tubes (eccentric cromo).\nNS COMPONENTS\nNS Bikes aftermarket components in unique finishes.",
